          "body": "The Fiji men's national Sevens squad will be featured on limited-edition Coca-Cola cans and bottles to celebrate their iconic tournament performances. Officially launched at Albert Park in Suva, the commemorative collectables will highlight eight memorable moments from the team's 2025 Hong Kong and Singapore campaigns. Fiji Rugby commercial director Tevita Tuiloa welcomed the partnership, stating that the initiative celebrates the unique bond between the sport and local communities while inspiring future generations."
