          "heading": "England hooker Jamie Blamire returns from injury to start for Leicester",
          "body": "England hooker Jamie Blamire has recovered from injury to start for Leicester Tigers in the Slater Cup clash against Gloucester at Mattioli Woods Welford Road. The front-rower's return is one of five changes made by coach Geoff Parling following last weekend's victory over Newcastle. England international Freddie Steward retains his starting place at full-back, whilst scrum-half Jack van Poortvliet captains the side. Blamire's immediate return to fitness provides a welcome front-row boost ahead of next month's international fixtures."
