          "heading": "Victor Wembanyama credits French club Provence Rugby for inspiring team spirit",
          "body": "French club Provence Rugby hosted NBA star Victor Wembanyama during his summer off-season, with the 7ft 4in Frenchman joining passing drills and line-outs to develop his physical strength. The 22-year-old San Antonio Spurs player, who was joined by team-mate Harrison Barnes, praised the second-tier side's unity and camaraderie. 'It was a great experience, seeing the team spirit they have over there,' Wembanyama said of his stint with Provence, who have started their promotion push with five consecutive league wins."
