          "body": "Italy's men's national side have struggled for defensive stability, conceding 318 points across their last 11 fixtures. In that same 11-game window, the Azzurri scored 190 points, averaging 17.3 points scored per match. Their opponents averaged 28.9 points per game in those same 11 matches. The biggest victory for Italy in this 11-game block came when they beat Chile 34-19 at home in November 2025 during the international friendlies."
